package [shape: oval, icon: package]\n}\n\nIssue ready to claim [shape: oval, icon: send]\n\nIssue type? > Bug\nBug > Duplicate?\nDuplicate? > Mark duplicate: Yes\nDuplicate? > Has repro?: No\nHas repro? > Issue ready to claim: Yes\nHas repro? > Ask for repro: No\nIssue type? > Feature\nFeature > Can be package?\nCan be package? > Well specced?: No\nCan be package? > Define as package: Yes\nWell specced? > Issue ready to claim: Yes".trim(),s="\nAPI gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway]\nLambda [icon: aws-lambda]\nS3 [icon: aws-simple-storage-service]\n\nVPC Subnet [icon: aws-vpc] {\n  Main Server {\n    Server [icon: aws-ec2]\n    Data [icon: aws-rds]\n  }\n\n  Queue [icon: aws-auto-scaling]\n\n  Compute Nodes [color: red] {\n    Worker1 [icon: aws-ec2]\n    Worker2 [icon: aws-ec2]\n    Worker3 [icon: aws-ec2]\n  }\n}\n\nAnalytics [icon: aws-redshift]\n\nAPI gateway > Lambda > Server > Data\nServer > Queue\nQueue > Worker1, Worker2, Worker3\nS3 < Data\nCompute Nodes > Analytics".trim(),l="\ntitle Online Order Fulfillment\n\nCustomer {\n  Need product [type: event]\n  Place order [type: activity, icon: shopping-cart]\n  Shipment received [type: event, icon: mail]\n  Order completed [type: event]\n}\n\nOnline Store {\n  Sales {\n    Verify payment [type: activity, icon: credit-card]\n    Payment approved? [type: gateway, icon: x]\n    Generate pick list [type: activity, icon: list]\n  }\n  Warehouse {\n    Pick items [type: activity, icon: box]\n    Pack & label shipment [type: activity, icon: package]\n    Ship order [type: activity, icon: truck]\n    Shipped [type: event]\n  }\n}\n\nNeed product > Place order\nPlace order --\x3e Verify payment : Order\nVerify payment > Payment approved?\nPayment approved? > Generate pick list : Yes\nPayment approved? --\x3e Order completed : Payment declined\nGenerate pick list --\x3e Pick items : Pick list\nPick items > Pack & label shipment\nPack & label shipment > Ship order\nPlace order > Shipment received\nShip order --\x3e Shipment 